  "description": " Erection of a rear roof extension with  the installation of 2no rooflights in the front roofslope and 1no rooflight above the main flat roof at roof level; erection of a 'pod' rear extension at second floor level over part of the existing back addition; erection of a single storey rear extension, to the side of the existing back addition following partial demolition of the ground floor back addition;  erection of a timber built side boundary fence in connection with the formation of a courtyard to the rear of the main building and installation of a door to replace an existing window, to the rear elevation at ground floor level; infilling of the existing window and installation of sliding doors at ground floor level to the rear elevation; de-conversion of the existing building from 2no self-contained flats into a single family dwellinghouse.",
